    "Content": "<p><strong>Azure SQL&mdash;Generally available updates for late April 2022</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In late April 2022, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/sql/relational-databases/track-changes/enable-and-disable-change-data-capture-sql-server?view=sql-server-ver15\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Track and record changes in your Azure SQL Databases through Change Data Capture</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure SQL—Generally available updates for late April 2022\n\nIn late April 2022, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:\n\nTrack and record changes in your Azure SQL Databases through Change Data Capture ."
